<title>USA: Temtex Q3 loss $0.11/shr vs loss $0.01.</title>
<headline>Temtex Q3 loss $0.11/shr vs loss $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended May 31</p>
<p>			   1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.11     loss		$0.01</p>
<p> Net	 loss	     376     loss	    27</p>
<p> Revs			 8,479		    9,660</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,477		    3,467</p>
<p>			   Nine Months ended May 31</p>
<p>			   1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.08  profit	   $0.15</p>
<p> Net     profit	     289   profit	   520</p>
<p> Revs			30,550		   31,713</p>
<p> Avg			  3,482		    3,485</p>
<p>	    (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Temtex Industries Inc. The company's chief executive Edwin Buford said in a statement &quot;unusually wet weather&quot; in the Midwest and Southwest adversely affected third-quarter sales. Temtex is a manufacturer of firplaces.</p>
</text>
